WEBVTT

00:43:58.270 --> 00:44:00.314
and what you leave behind
is the reputation

00:44:00.338 --> 00:44:02.299
of the work you did while you were there.

00:44:02.323 --> 00:44:08.263
So you might be angry
and you might be sort of, mailing it in,

00:44:08.287 --> 00:44:11.342
but people aren't going to give you
the benefit of the doubt

00:44:11.366 --> 00:44:14.642
that you were mailing it in
because the company wasn't doing great,

00:44:14.666 --> 00:44:17.157
they're just going to remember
that you mailed it in.

00:44:17.181 --> 00:44:18.654
And so I think always remember

00:44:18.678 --> 00:44:21.296
that you are managing
your identity and your reputation

00:44:21.320 --> 00:44:22.606
and that travels with you.

00:44:22.630 --> 00:44:24.703
And so when things get bad,

00:44:24.727 --> 00:44:26.247
do right by people.

00:44:26.873 --> 00:44:28.991
Even if that's not
what the company is doing,

00:44:29.015 --> 00:44:31.467
stand your ground
for the things that matter to you,